1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
A productive day starts the night before.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,640
Wake up at the same time every
morning, even on weekends.

3
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:10,840
Drink a full glass of water
before you reach for your phone.

4
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:15,500
Spend 10 minutes moving your body
with a short walk or some stretching.

5
00:00:16,075 --> 00:00:19,480
Then write down the three most
important tasks for the day.

6
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:23,280
Start with the hardest one
while your mind is still fresh.
